              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth latimo wor gi Yakobo to yero Isiraili kendo, laketho jo i lowo pajo wegi; aka jopath jolabino bedo gi jo to joriwere gi ot pa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonin jolakelo jo i kabedo pajo, aka ot pa Isiraili latero jo i lowo pa Rwoth paka ŋecin ma cwo gi ma mon. Isiraili lamako jono ma cango jomako jo, aka ladhumo jono ma cango jodiyo jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Podho pa kere ma Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
